T:Immortal, Invisible, God Only Wise
T:ST DENIO
C:Music: traditional Welsh found in "Caniadau y Cyssegr" by John Roberts, 1839 · Words: Walter Chalmers Smith, 1876
S:Open Hymnal Project ABC (openhymnal.org; marked public domain), melody line with every stanza as printed there; their source: Episcopal Hymnal, 1940, Hymn 301. Also in English Hymnal, 1906 Hymn 407 (page missing in my copy). Setting from "Caniadau y Cyssegr a'r Teulu", 1878 hymn 442, a. Melody cross-checked against the hymnary.org score (hymnary.org/tune/st_denio): 100% of pitches and 100% of note lengths agree.
